						<section class="designer">
							<div class="container">
								<div class="designer-inner relative">
									<h1 class="absolute top-0 left-0 text-[186px] whitespace-nowrap">Lorem Ipsum</h1>
									<div class="designer-photo relative" style="width:478px;height:478px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden">
										<img src="/assets/loop.png" alt="" class="absolute top-0 left-0" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block" />
										<img src="/assets/mia.png" alt="designer" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block" />
									</div>
									<div class="bio">
										<p>山路を登りながら、こう考えた。智に働けば角が立つ。情に棹させば流される。意地を通せば窮屈だ。とかくに人の世は住みにくい。住みにくさが高じると、安い所へ引き越したくなる。</p>
										<p class="name"><span style="font-weight:500;font-size:18px">斎藤 ミア</span> <span>/</span> <span style="font-weight:500;font-size:15px">MIA SAITO</span></p>
									</div>
								</div>


								<!-- TOPICS を designer セクション内に移動 -->
								<div class="topics">
									<div class="topics-box">
										<div class="topics-header">
											<div class="line"></div>
											<div class="star">✦</div>
											<div class="line"></div>
										</div>
										<h3 class="topics-title">TOPICS</h3>
										<div class="topic-cards">
											<div class="topic-card">
												<div class="topic-image">
													<img src="/assets/topic1.png" alt="topic 1" />
												</div>
												<h4 class="topic-name">consectetur adipisicing</h4>
												<p class="topic-desc">山路を登りながら、こう考えた。智に働けば角が立つ。</p>
